# Data artifacts — dated raw downloads and the full price cache stay
# ignored (large, regenerable in well under a minute via ingestion.py);
# the small pipeline-summary outputs are tracked so the scheduled GitHub
# Action (see .github/workflows/) can commit refreshed numbers for the
# dashboard's History tab to read.
# NOTE: data/outputs/ is intentionally NOT ignored as a directory — a
# directory-level ignore blocks "!" exceptions for files inside it, so we
# ignore by extension instead and allowlist the specific files below.
data/raw/
data/processed/
*.parquet
*.json
*.log
!data/outputs/backtest_results.parquet
!data/outputs/weights_history.parquet
!data/outputs/metrics.json

